        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Little Desktop Runner is a <strong>minimal interaction game</strong> about going on runs. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Automatically level up and run further, <strong>collect achievements</strong> and reach the end of the world.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Minimal Gameplay</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Press run and get back to work, your little runner will put the work in and let you know when they're ready to go.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4167350/extras/99eeff5372737fb0d467c0c1e10e2f26.poster.avif?t=1773030964\" width=638 height=398 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4167350/extras/99eeff5372737fb0d467c0c1e10e2f26.webm?t=1773030964\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4167350/extras/99eeff5372737fb0d467c0c1e10e2f26.mp4?t=1773030964\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Upgrade your Homestead</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Automatically gather resources and <strong>build up your homestead</strong> between runs to further improve running distance!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4167350/extras/7d2b66c68565e574c265b8251a8c629d.poster.avif?t=1773030964\" width=636 height=396 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4167350/extras/7d2b66c68565e574c265b8251a8c629d.webm?t=1773030964\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4167350/extras/7d2b66c68565e574c265b8251a8c629d.mp4?t=1773030964\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4167350/extras/7919cb617031c4d351631ea570f34933.poster.avif?t=1773030964\" width=638 height=398 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4167350/extras/7919cb617031c4d351631ea570f34933.webm?t=1773030964\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4167350/extras/7919cb617031c4d351631ea570f34933.mp4?t=1773030964\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Background Game</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sits in the corner of your desktop and <strong>makes sounds when it wants your attention</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4167350/extras/c1f349060cd91aeca73172f00a98976f.poster.avif?t=1773030964\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4167350/extras/c1f349060cd91aeca73172f00a98976f.webm?t=1773030964\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4167350/extras/c1f349060cd91aeca73172f00a98976f.mp4?t=1773030964\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's that simple!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What To Expect</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is not an offline idle game, the game must be open to progress</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Around 9-12 hours to complete game</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is no music, only sounds to occasionally grab your attention</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can be completed more efficiency with some active play</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Continue past the goal forever (the game will probably break eventually)</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Little Desktop Runner is a <strong>minimal interaction game</strong> about going on runs. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Automatically level up and run further, <strong>collect achievements</strong> and reach the end of the world.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Minimal Gameplay</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Press run and get back to work, your little runner will put the work in and let you know when they're ready to go.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4167350/extras/99eeff5372737fb0d467c0c1e10e2f26.poster.avif?t=1773030964\" width=638 height=398 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4167350/extras/99eeff5372737fb0d467c0c1e10e2f26.webm?t=1773030964\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4167350/extras/99eeff5372737fb0d467c0c1e10e2f26.mp4?t=1773030964\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Upgrade your Homestead</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Automatically gather resources and <strong>build up your homestead</strong> between runs to further improve running distance!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4167350/extras/7d2b66c68565e574c265b8251a8c629d.poster.avif?t=1773030964\" width=636 height=396 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4167350/extras/7d2b66c68565e574c265b8251a8c629d.webm?t=1773030964\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4167350/extras/7d2b66c68565e574c265b8251a8c629d.mp4?t=1773030964\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4167350/extras/7919cb617031c4d351631ea570f34933.poster.avif?t=1773030964\" width=638 height=398 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4167350/extras/7919cb617031c4d351631ea570f34933.webm?t=1773030964\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4167350/extras/7919cb617031c4d351631ea570f34933.mp4?t=1773030964\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Background Game</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sits in the corner of your desktop and <strong>makes sounds when it wants your attention</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4167350/extras/c1f349060cd91aeca73172f00a98976f.poster.avif?t=1773030964\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4167350/extras/c1f349060cd91aeca73172f00a98976f.webm?t=1773030964\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4167350/extras/c1f349060cd91aeca73172f00a98976f.mp4?t=1773030964\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's that simple!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What To Expect</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is not an offline idle game, the game must be open to progress</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Around 9-12 hours to complete game</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There is no music, only sounds to occasionally grab your attention</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can be completed more efficiency with some active play</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Continue past the goal forever (the game will probably break eventually)</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
